{"ticker":"JUBLINGREA","symbol":"JUBLINGREA","instrumentId":3169552,"name":"Jubilant Ingrevia","industry":"NSE-Diversified Operations","about":"Jubilant Ingrevia Ltd. is a global provider of integrated life science products and innovative solutions, serving industries such as pharmaceuticals, nutrition, agrochemicals, and consumer goods. The company operates across three segments: Specialty Chemicals, Nutrition and Health Solutions, and Life Science Chemicals. It is a world leader in pyridine and its derivatives, offering a broad portfolio of high-quality ingredients. Jubilant Ingrevia also provides custom development and manufacturing services for pharmaceutical and agrochemical clients. Committed to innovation and cutting-edge technology, the company continuously strives to enrich lives by delivering cost-effective, sustainable, and reliable solutions to its global customer base.","website":"www.jubilantingrevia.com","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:33:35.809Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":573.7,"changePct":-2.2407770299054235,"week52High":763.8,"week52Low":541.3},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹9,138 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹4,924 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"87,604,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"167"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"51,140,398"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.87%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"2.89"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.7"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"10.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.07"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.33"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-9%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"25.83"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"20–72"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"8.9%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"32.91"},{"label":"Volume","value":"98,994"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"378,021"},{"label":"Master score","value":"54"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"59"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"